<title>UK: EU maize tariff cut 59.77 Ecus per tonne.</title>
<headline>EU maize tariff cut 59.77 Ecus per tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted a maximum tariff cut of 59.77 Ecus per tonne for 328,703 tonnes of prefential maize imports to Spain, member country officials said.  </p>
<p>Member country officials had earlier pegged the tonnage at around 328,000 tonnes without specifying the tariff cut.</p>
<p>The awards are part of a scheme to allow preferential maize imports to Spain from the United States under a 1987 trade pact.</p>
</text>
